# Zhifei's flow-matic root for the Sonnet-vs-Opus 5.5 Claude Code re-test on 100 fresh tasks:
# the same evolve root as andy-flowmatic, run from its own worktree at canonical so it does not
# share a tree with the pilot40 arms. Selected with TRL_PROFILE=andy-flowmatic-canon.
TRL_BASE=/var/tmp/tw-eval/evolve
TRL_TT=/var/tmp/tw-eval/tt-canon
